{"id":"2c47b3f229469a93","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-cor-gch-properties.md","title":"GCH Properties","display":"cor-gch-properties — GCH Properties","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-gch-properties","aliases":["58-cor-gch-properties"],"display":"cor-gch-properties — GCH Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-gch]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-gch-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-gch-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gch-properties — GCH Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"58-df-gch\">58-df-gch</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (基数参数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> (广义连续统假设命题, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"58-df-gch\">58-df-gch</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gch-properties} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH} \\to \\forall \\kappa\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to 2^\\kappa=\\min\\{\\lambda:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gch-properties} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH} \\to \\forall \\kappa\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to 2^\\kappa=\\min\\{\\lambda:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under GCH, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\kappa} = \\kappa^{+}\">\\(2^{\\kappa} = \\kappa^{+}\\)</span> for all infinite cardinals.</li>\n<li>GCH simplifies cardinal arithmetic significantly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-gch","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gch]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (基数参数, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (基数谓词, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gch","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GCH}$ (广义连续统假设命题, see [[58-df-gch]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GCH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gch-properties} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH} \\to \\forall \\kappa\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to 2^\\kappa=\\min\\{\\lambda:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"2^{\\kappa} = \\kappa^{+}","display":false}],"bytes":858,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-cor-gch-properties.md|58-cor-gch-properties]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}